        "created_at": "2014-02-07T02:19:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been muling over this since Rook City. https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/hairtrigger-reflexes-vs-fowl</p><p>I did not buy the new RC/IR re-release so I don't know how the card text have changed. What is the new wordings on Matriarch's cards to address this issue? Will someone post new Matriarch's card images? Thanks. :)</p><p>How does the new order-of-play ruling fit in?</p><p>(ps. If this has already been resolved, please point me in the right direction.)</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:14.057Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
