        "raw": "<p>I&#39;ve been muling over this since Rook City. https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/hairtrigger-reflexes-vs-fowl</p><p>I did not buy the new RC/IR re-release so I don&#39;t know how the card text have changed. What is the new wordings on Matriarch&#39;s cards to address this issue? Will someone post new Matriarch&#39;s card images? Thanks. :)</p><p>How does the new order-of-play ruling fit in?</p><p>(ps. If this has already been resolved, please point me in the right direction.)</p>",
