        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/9de053/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-07T02:29:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The text which plays a new card after every Fowl is now on Matriarch's card, so it will happen regardless of what happens to the birds.&nbsp; HTR can kill every Bird as it comes out (triggering retaliation from Matriarch of course), but it doesn't stop the extra card plays from happening - it never did, the new ruels just make it easier to comprehend why.</p>",
